  "notes": "Cash basis county. Basic statement figures from Exhibit B (p2) Total Governmental Funds column. Taxes line 2,313,096 split using Exhibit A (p1): property tax levied 1,988,973 + inheritance tax 324,123. Local receipts 530,316 split by fund column: charges for services 529,942 and Inheritance Fund interest 374 (Exhibit A p1). State receipts 1,527,750 equals Exhibit A property tax relief. Transfers: Exhibit B total column is blank (745,000 in/out eliminated), so transfers_in/out are null; net effect zero. Roll-forward: 2,274,084 + 4,391,612 - 4,262,449 = 2,403,247. Balance sheet taken from Exhibit A (p1), assets are cash only, no liabilities; Exhibit B p3 shows restricted 501,976, committed 1,458,543, unassigned 442,728. Detail: General Fund budget schedule (Sched 2, pp5-8) recorded by department and object; operating expense lines have no object description so placed in miscellaneous expenditure with review. Sched 2 final-budget columns used as budget_final. Nonmajor funds (Sched 1 p4) recorded per fund; Sched 2-5 are the major funds. Read pages 1-11 of 11"
